00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:21.643
Where'd you grow up?

00:00:21.643 --> 00:00:22.700
- [Ruth] Africa.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:23.662
- [Interviewer] Africa?

00:00:23.662 --> 00:00:24.980
- Mhmm.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.647
- [Interviewer] And tell
me about your family.

00:00:26.647 --> 00:00:29.657
Did you grow up with both of your parents?

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:34.410
- Uh, Mr. McConaughey, is that your name?

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.243
- [Interviewer] I'm sorry?

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:36.076
- Mr. McConaughey?

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.650
I did not grow up with my parents, no.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:40.850
They were there in part.

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:44.870
- [Interviewer] And what
happened with your parents?

00:00:47.277 --> 00:00:51.950
- Oh, they enlisted
some aid to care for me.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.770
