00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.810
in their pursuit of political power.

00:00:58.810 --> 00:01:03.620
And so, part of them gaining
political power was to move.

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:05.573
And when we moved, we lost contact.

00:01:07.037 --> 00:01:08.954
My family did, with me.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:11.800
My folks did, I mean.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.200
- [Interviewer] How old are you, Ruth?

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:14.140
- Ten.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:14.973
- [Interviewer] You're ten?

00:01:14.973 --> 00:01:15.806
- Mhmm.

00:01:16.698 --> 00:01:17.531
- [Interviewer] Do you have any--

00:01:17.531 --> 00:01:18.364
- What'd you call me...?

00:01:18.364 --> 00:01:19.197
- [Interviewer] Do you have any family?

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:24.670
I prefer Marcy, but (mumbles)

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.983
- [Interviewer] Do, do
you have any family?

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.160
- Yes, yup. As a matter
of fact Sissy Spacek

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.640
is my sister.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:37.793
Yeah she did the movie "Carrie",
perhaps you've heard of it.

00:01:37.793 --> 00:01:39.180
- [Interviewer] Yes.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.111
- Carrie had great a
great deal of telepathic

00:01:41.111 --> 00:01:43.100
or telekinetic powers.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:44.453
Um.. telekinesis.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.920
