00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.053
I failed to return.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:54.290
I'm going to hunt her (mumbles)

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:56.183
- [Interviewer] Ruth,
where do you stay at night?

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:58.423
Do you stay in a tent?

00:01:58.423 --> 00:02:00.430
- [Ruth] In Whoville Alley.
Yes, I live in a tent.

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:01.850
And you're welcome to visit.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.240
- [Interviewer] Okay.

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:06.450
