00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:13.550
The one from the movie.

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:15.130
Um...

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:17.400
The name Lambert rings a bell.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.204
He played the role of Warlock. Yeah.

00:02:19.204 --> 00:02:20.037
