00:02:20.969 --> 00:02:23.190
Do you do any of the drugs
that are on the street?

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:27.400
- I used um, I used something
new called Pyramid recently.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.480
That's an android drug.

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:30.510
It was very bad for me.

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.100
It ruined my eye sight.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.730
And you know, it's already bad enough.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:35.060
It's not really eye sight.

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:35.893
I'm sorry.

00:02:35.893 --> 00:02:38.280
But... I used methamphetamine.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.577
- [Interviewer] You used crystal meth?

00:02:39.577 --> 00:02:40.520
- [Ruth] Crystal meth. Right.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:41.353
And I used...

00:02:41.353 --> 00:02:43.083
Um... Cocaine.

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:47.500
I also used a little bit
of 'shroom, or angel dust.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.860
You ever heard of it?
- [Interviewer] Yup.

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:50.570
